Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： HSQ-Rip
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕時間軸由kewenyu調整以適應當前作品
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.27,0:00:06.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Cosmic Era 72
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.95,0:00:10.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球·Plant之間歷時一年半的戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:15.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,終於在雅金·多維宇域的戰鬥中迎來了終結
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.87,0:00:18.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,經過雙方同意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:22.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在過去的悲劇發生地猶尼奧斯七號上締結的條約
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:26.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,成為雙方今後相互理解努力追求和平的誓言
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:30.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,世界再次開始走向安定...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.43,0:00:33.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:34.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,密涅瓦出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.67,0:00:37.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這艘船要外出戰鬥嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.12,0:00:38.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.68,0:00:41.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.28,0:00:42.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哪來的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.57,0:00:46.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來 這台機體也收下了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.17,0:02:33.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.80,0:02:37.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在幹什麼 發呆的話只會變成靶子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.84,0:02:39.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這個敵人與眾不同
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.37,0:02:42.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.81,0:02:51.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,氣密正常 FCS接通
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.43,0:02:54.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,密涅瓦所有部門正常
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.54,0:02:55.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快索敵
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.12,0:02:57.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse和Zaku的位置是？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.20,0:03:03.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Indigo53 Mark22 Bravo 不明戰艦1 距離150
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:06.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是母艦嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.16,0:03:08.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,登錄到資料庫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.43,0:03:10.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以後將物件稱為BogeyOne
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.18,0:03:15.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,同方位157 Mark80 Alpha 有Impulse和Zaku
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.53,0:03:16.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎在交戰中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.99,0:03:17.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能呼叫嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:21.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不能 電波干擾嚴重 無法通信
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.80,0:03:22.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,敵人的數量是？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.01,0:03:26.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一架 但這是 MA
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:39.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.23,0:03:50.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,攻擊BogeyOne 艦橋遮蔽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.53,0:03:53.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,航向Indigo Delta
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.65,0:03:58.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,加速20% 信號彈和反光線爆雷發射準備
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:01.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿薩 在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.25,0:04:03.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:08.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射管一號至四號Neidhart裝填
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.82,0:04:11.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Tristan一號二號 Isolde啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.05,0:04:13.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,照準BogeyOne
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.43,0:04:18.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,難道不該先救他們嗎 艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:21.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 所以要攻擊母艦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.34,0:04:26.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要引開敵人這樣最快 這種場合下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.88,0:04:32.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,似戰艦熱源接近
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.93,0:04:36.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,類別不明 Red53 Mark80 Delta
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:39.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那艘新型艦嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.03,0:04:43.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,右舵10度 加速30% Igelstellung啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.36,0:04:45.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Exus呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.96,0:04:47.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,母艦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.47,0:04:54.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不能偷雞不成蝕把米
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.54,0:05:03.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,密涅瓦？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.56,0:05:05.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,返航信號 為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.53,0:05:07.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是命令
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.73,0:05:09.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Neidhart 發射
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.80,0:05:12.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,回避
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.50,0:05:33.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瞄準引擎 拖住它
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:40.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Exus著艦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.78,0:05:42.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,撤退！理
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.35,0:05:45.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,BogeyOne 逃離
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.12,0:05:47.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Yellow71 Alpha
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.93,0:05:49.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse和Zaku呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:51.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,返航 收容中
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.43,0:05:55.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快 繼續一口氣打下BogeyOne
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:56.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,航向Yellow Alpha
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.96,0:06:09.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大佐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.03,0:06:11.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 玩過火了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.95,0:06:15.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,敵艦繼續接近 Blue0 距離110
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:19.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,非常快的一艘船 很麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.47,0:06:22.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,導彈接近
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.71,0:06:24.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,左舵 避開
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.24,0:06:31.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,兩舷的備用燃料箱分離後爆破
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.15,0:06:33.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,連支架一起也無所謂 濺他們一臉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.33,0:06:37.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,同是上仰35 左舵10 引擎最大
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.81,0:06:47.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.74,0:06:49.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.59,0:07:00.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,BogeyOne 船體一部分分離
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.48,0:07:04.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,停止射擊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.77,0:07:07.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,右舵10 引擎最大
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.99,0:07:17.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.99,0:07:18.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.11,0:07:20.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦橋 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.83,0:07:23.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.41,0:07:24.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}各部門報告情況
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.84,0:07:26.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,巴特 敵艦位置是？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.67,0:07:28.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請稍等 還未...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.71,0:07:31.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,CIWS啟動 反光線爆雷發射
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.87,0:07:33.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上會打過來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.43,0:07:38.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了 Red88 Mark6 Charley 距離500
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.25,0:07:40.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,逃了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.67,0:07:43.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.57,0:07:46.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有一手 能用這種辦法逃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.25,0:07:49.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看來是支很難纏的部隊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.91,0:07:53.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那更不能讓他們這樣跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.74,0:07:56.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,機體如果落到那種人手上...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.81,0:07:57.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.94,0:08:00.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在雖然已經無法下船
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:04.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但我認為本艦應該繼續追擊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:06.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長如何判斷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.59,0:08:11.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不用在意我的事 艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.32,0:08:13.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,星星之火可以燎原
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.19,0:08:19.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我一想到這裏就感到害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.09,0:08:25.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奪回或擊毀它是現階段的最優先任務
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.27,0:08:27.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.95,0:08:28.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,軌跡有嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:29.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還能追蹤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.81,0:08:35.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本艦開始繼續追擊BogeyOne
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.59,0:08:38.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,航向Yellow Alpha 引擎最大
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.28,0:08:40.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,航向Yellow Alpha 引擎最大
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.79,0:08:50.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,告知全船 本艦開始繼續追擊BogeyOne
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:53.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然在緊急情況下突然經歷了初陣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:55.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這是非常重要的任務
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.92,0:08:56.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.20,0:09:01.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全員盡力發揮日常訓練的成果
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.03,0:09:03.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦橋遮蔽解除
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.73,0:09:06.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在發生情況前轉移至黃色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.97,0:09:08.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦橋遮蔽解除
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.22,0:09:09.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,轉移至黃色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.33,0:09:12.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長也到艦長室去休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.91,0:09:14.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,密涅瓦雖然對腳力很有自信
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.22,0:09:17.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但敵人也是相當程度的高速戰艦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.73,0:09:19.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不會馬上有什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.51,0:09:22.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷 幫忙帶路
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.36,0:09:22.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.62,0:09:25.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.74,0:09:26.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.72,0:09:29.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為是戰鬥中 未能即時報告
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.08,0:09:35.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本艦出擊時在格納庫發現兩名搭乘Zaku的平民
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.87,0:09:40.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拘捕後其中一人自稱是奧布聯合酋長國首相
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.84,0:09:43.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉·尤拉·阿斯哈和其隨從
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.15,0:09:47.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望得到傷勢救治 並會見迪蘭達爾議長
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.43,0:09:49.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布的？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.53,0:09:52.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她怎麼會在這船上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.36,0:09:58.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我擅自決定為她處理了傷勢 現正在軍官室休息
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.42,0:10:38.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,算是成功了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.04,0:10:40.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,離到B座標還有多久
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.76,0:10:41.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,2小時左右
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.36,0:10:44.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你認為還會有追擊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.89,0:10:45.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.40,0:10:49.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為不知道所以選擇預定路線
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.82,0:10:53.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,預測應該多往壞處想嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.39,0:10:55.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,特別是戰場上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.72,0:10:59.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們的再適應性調整如何
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.67,0:11:01.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大致上似乎沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.91,0:11:04.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,都睡得正香呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:09.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是 奧盧似乎對史黛拉使用了Block Word
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.26,0:11:12.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這也許有點麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.30,0:11:17.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,每次出事就得放回搖籃的機師
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.71,0:11:20.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,實驗室真的認為能派上用場嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.07,0:11:23.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即使這樣 也比以前的好多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.08,0:11:27.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能完全理解我們的意思並完成
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.85,0:11:34.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法 現在所有都屬於試驗階段
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.56,0:11:40.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦船 MS 機師 世界也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:42.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.13,0:11:46.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,終有一天一切都將真正開始
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.78,0:11:49.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在我們的名義下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.76,0:11:55.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在忙活什麼 Zaku的拆卸作業不是早用程式做好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.41,0:11:57.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,照著做就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.05,0:11:59.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:01.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.45,0:12:04.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,實戰像假的一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.79,0:12:05.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.80,0:12:08.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼突然變成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.84,0:12:15.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 不會就這樣變成戰爭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.48,0:12:16.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也這麼想
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.96,0:12:29.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真不知該如何道歉 把公主也牽連進來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.35,0:12:32.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但希望您也能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.49,0:12:37.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,關於那支部隊還一無所知嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.40,0:12:43.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 艦船上也沒有任何明顯的標誌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.09,0:12:51.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但正因為如此我們才必須儘快控制事態
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.03,0:12:54.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在發生無法挽回的事之前
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:58.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白 這是當然的 議長
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.61,0:13:05.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在無論如何不能發生刺激世界形勢的事件 絕對
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.89,0:13:12.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感謝 我一直相信公主也會這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.24,0:13:19.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有興趣的話 趁還有時間在艦上四處走走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.66,0:13:20.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.18,0:13:25.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即使只是暫時性的 但畢竟要將性命託付於此
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.28,0:13:30.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這也算我國作為盟友最起碼的誠意
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.35,0:13:58.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布的阿斯哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.86,0:14:01.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我也吃了一驚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.48,0:14:04.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到在這裏遇上大戰時的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.17,0:14:08.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 那台Zaku有什麼不對嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.54,0:14:12.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有 因為不是密涅瓦配置的機體
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.51,0:14:14.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知是誰在駕駛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.30,0:14:17.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,據說是護衛的人在操縱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.47,0:14:20.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然自稱阿雷克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.25,0:14:23.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但也許是阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.99,0:14:27.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,首相是這樣叫的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:30.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,突然叫那個人阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:37.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭·薩拉 不是傳說現在在奧布嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.47,0:14:39.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭·薩拉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.72,0:14:43.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說起來 這艘船也不容易啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.42,0:14:49.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下水儀式前一天突然被迫經歷實戰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.27,0:14:54.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,從這裏可以上到MS甲板
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.24,0:15:04.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基本位於艦船的中心位置
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.96,0:15:08.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,搭載可能數量當然無法奉告
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.30,0:15:12.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在也並非滿載狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.80,0:15:22.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ZGMF-1000 Zaku您已經知道了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.77,0:15:25.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在紮夫特軍的主力機體
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.86,0:15:32.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,作為密涅瓦最大特徵的出擊系統是Impulse在使用
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.97,0:15:34.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,據說在工廠內已經見過了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.38,0:15:36.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.96,0:15:38.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,照技術人員的話說
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.78,0:15:43.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是最新型的高效率MS系統
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.36,0:15:47.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我對技術性的技術問題不太瞭解
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.87,0:15:52.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看來公主不太喜歡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.80,0:15:55.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長挺高興的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.71,0:15:58.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也說不上“高興”
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.59,0:16:02.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家在那種混亂情況下拼命努力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.80,0:16:07.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,方能擁有這樣的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.30,0:16:08.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,力量嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.95,0:16:13.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長說過“無法消除爭端所以需要力量”吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.31,0:16:14.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.23,0:16:18.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 對這次的事您有何感想
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.27,0:16:24.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對那三台MS給貴國造成的損失
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.77,0:16:25.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,首相
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.87,0:16:29.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以就不該擁有力量嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.97,0:16:33.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說到底事到如今為什麼還需要有那種東西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.64,0:16:38.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們發過誓 不再重複悲劇
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.52,0:16:41.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牽手共同前進
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.17,0:16:43.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這個嘛 但是公主...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.66,0:16:46.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說漂亮話不愧是阿斯哈家的看家本領
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.17,0:16:48.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.44,0:16:50.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.70,0:17:02.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,BogeyOne 捕捉到了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.89,0:17:05.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Orange55 Mark90 Alpha
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.64,0:17:09.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Yellow50 Mark82 Charley 大型熱源
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.58,0:17:10.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離8000
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.32,0:17:13.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發現敵艦 距離8000
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.87,0:17:15.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發佈紅色狀態命令
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.53,0:17:17.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,機師到機體內待機
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.80,0:17:20.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,最終檢查趕快 要開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.71,0:17:21.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.22,0:17:24.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.92,0:17:28.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,非常抱歉 議長
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.81,0:17:30.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,過後一定予以處分
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.49,0:17:35.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的非常抱歉 公主
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.82,0:17:38.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他是奧布來的移民
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.80,0:17:41.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到會說出這種話
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.33,0:17:48.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,果然來了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.94,0:17:53.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 說明紮夫特也並非還沒睡醒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.01,0:17:55.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在這裏直接做個了斷
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.72,0:17:57.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全員戰鬥配置
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.44,0:17:58.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,機師到待機室
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.47,0:18:03.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對方雖不至於特意往碎石帶裏鑽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.89,0:18:05.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但會在危險宇域發生戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.36,0:18:07.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦船操縱就拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:08.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.11,0:18:11.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真和露娜瑪利亞先發制人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.60,0:18:12.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,結束了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.74,0:18:13.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.66,0:18:15.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離目標6500
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.64,0:18:18.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.08,0:18:20.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題吧 艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.15,0:18:25.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我想讓奧布的兩位也進入艦橋
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.02,0:18:28.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這個...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.31,0:18:33.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正如你所知 首相在上次大戰中也曾指揮艦船
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.11,0:18:36.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,經歷了諸多戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.05,0:18:42.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以希望讓她觀看一下這艘船的戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.84,0:18:47.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了 如果這是議長的願望
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.83,0:18:50.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,多謝 塔里婭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.53,0:18:54.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離目標6000
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.13,0:18:56.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦橋遮蔽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.70,0:18:59.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對艦對MS戰鬥準備
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.83,0:19:03.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是那艘新型艦？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.91,0:19:07.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 來得會是那個合體佬吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.16,0:19:09.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那這次是五馬分屍還是活捉？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.23,0:19:13.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不論哪種 又有樂子了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.66,0:19:14.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:26.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射固定器
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.79,0:19:29.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,同時引擎停止 誘餌發射
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.01,0:19:31.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別錯過時機
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.76,0:19:50.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜瑪利亞·霍克 Zaku Warrior出擊待命
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.17,0:19:52.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全系統啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.73,0:19:54.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開始出擊程式
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.14,0:20:05.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse出擊待命
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.00,0:20:10.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,選擇火影系統 幻影機庫三號開啟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.07,0:20:12.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,平臺設定完成
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.25,0:20:14.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,中央彈射器啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.19,0:20:16.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,關閉氣密閘門
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.74,0:20:20.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,核心戰機全系統啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.43,0:20:22.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開始出擊程式
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.35,0:20:26.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艙門打開 確認彈射系統銜接
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.30,0:20:33.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,目標航向不變 距離4700
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.61,0:20:35.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Zaku Impulse 出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.89,0:20:39.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說漂亮話不愧是阿斯哈家的看家本領
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.44,0:20:42.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為他是奧布的移民
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.30,0:20:50.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Gunner Zaku Warrior 連接彈射器
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.97,0:20:57.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜瑪利亞·霍克 Zaku出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.36,0:21:10.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,BogeyOne嗎 那艘船真正的名稱到底叫什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.49,0:21:14.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下一個 Impulse 請
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.79,0:21:18.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真·飛鳥 核心戰機出發
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.42,0:21:54.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,名稱是其存在的表現
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.77,0:21:58.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果那是假的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.63,0:22:10.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是假的話 其存在本身也是虛假
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.35,0:22:12.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.46,0:22:15.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿雷克斯 不
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.97,0:22:17.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭·薩拉君
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.43,0:23:26.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為擁有力量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.79,0:23:29.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是因為存在爭端
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.40,0:23:32.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,默默流逝的時間長河中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.60,0:23:34.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,至今未能有答案出現
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.20,0:23:39.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但現在互相面對所期待的是？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.22,0:23:44.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 機動戰士GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.64,0:23:46.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,星屑的戰場
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.39,0:23:49.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,顯示你的力量吧 Zaku
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,
